---
import { appPath } from '../lib/urls';
import StudioMock from './StudioMock.astro';

const loginUrl = appPath('/login');
const howUrl = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}#how-it-works`;
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-deck-side text-white">
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-80"
    aria-hidden="true"
    style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 55% at 70% 20%, rgba(15, 108, 120, 0.35), transparent 60%), radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 40% at 10% 90%, rgba(15, 108, 120, 0.15), transparent);"
  ></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-10 px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-12 lg:py-24">
    <div class="text-center lg:text-left">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-deck-accent-soft/90">Google Drive ネイティブの資料作成</p>
      <h1 class="deckit-h1 mt-3 font-bold tracking-tight" data-jp-heading>
        <span class="block text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">DeckIt</span>
        <span class="mt-2 block text-2xl font-semibold text-deck-accent-soft sm:text-3xl">資料、できた。</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="deckit-lead mx-auto mt-5 max-w-xl text-[#c8d4dc] lg:mx-0" data-jp-wrap>
        元資料・Style・お手本を活かし、あなたらしい Google Slides を短時間で。資料本体はあなたの Drive に残ります。
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-stretch gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center lg:justify-start">
        <a
          href={loginUrl}
          class="deckit-tap inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-deck-side shadow-md hover:bg-deck-accent-soft"
        >
          Google でログイン
        </a>
        <a
          href={howUrl}
          class="deckit-tap inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/25 px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-white/90 hover:border-white/40 hover:bg-white/5"
        >
          使い方を見る
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-5 text-xs text-[#9fb0bc] sm:text-sm" data-jp-wrap>
        元資料 → 構成 → 生成 → 編集 · Style / Reference · 16:9 プレビュー
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-lg lg:max-w-none">
      <StudioMock />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
